  "faq": [
    {
      "q": "Deliverables me kitna time lagta hai?",
      "a": "Teaser reel 3-5 din me de dete hain social media ke liye. Raw data immediate after event, aur final edited photos & cinematic film me 4-6 weeks lagte hain."
    },
    {
      "q": "Destination wedding ke liye travel cost kaun bear karega?",
      "a": "Travel aur stay client end se hota hai. Hum travel arrangements khud kar sakte hain but it gets billed at actuals in the final invoice."
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you provide traditional photography also?",
      "a": "Yes. Har package me humare paas dedicated candid experts aur traditional photographers dono hote hain to ensure nothing is missed."
    },
    {
      "q": "Advance payment kitna hota hai?",
      "a": "To block the dates, we require a 40% advance. 40% on the day of the event, aur remaining 20% final deliverables handover ke time."
    }
  ],
